  <!--原中文: '「边魔」幽魂', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Spirit',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Spirit-->
  <TM_SpiritChildBS.title>「边魔」幽魂</TM_SpiritChildBS.title>
  <!--原中文: '幽魂', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Spirit',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Spirit-->
  <TM_SpiritChildBS.titleShort>幽魂</TM_SpiritChildBS.titleShort>
  <!--原中文: '[PAWN_nameDef]是一个游荡的灵魂，被某种未知的力量锚定在物质世界。关于灵魂的过去和未来会做什么，我们并不清楚，但[PAWN_possessive]力量足以让[PAWN_objective]完成[PAWN_objective]想做的一切。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: '[PAWN_nameDef] is a wandering spirit, anchored to this realm by some unknown force. The events surrounding [PAWN_possessive] origins are unknown, but powerful enough to cause [PAWN_objective] to seek answers, justice, or redemption from the living.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: [PAWN_nameDef] is a wandering spirit, anchored to this realm by some unknown force. The events surrounding [PAWN_possessive] origins are unknown, but powerful enough to cause [PAWN_objective] to seek answers, justice, or redemption from the living.-->
  <TM_SpiritChildBS.baseDesc>[PAWN_nameDef]是一个游荡的灵魂，被某种未知的力量锚定在物质世界。关于灵魂的过去和未来会做什么，我们并不清楚，但[PAWN_possessive]力量足以让[PAWN_objective]完成[PAWN_objective]想做的一切。</TM_SpiritChildBS.baseDesc>
  <!--原中文: '「边魔」远古的幽魂', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Ancient Spirit',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Ancient Spirit-->
  <TM_AncientSpiritAdultBS.title>「边魔」远古的幽魂</TM_AncientSpiritAdultBS.title>
  <!--原中文: '远古的幽魂', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Ancient Spirit',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Ancient Spirit-->
  <TM_AncientSpiritAdultBS.titleShort>远古的幽魂</TM_AncientSpiritAdultBS.titleShort>
  <!--原中文: '[PAWN_nameDef]已经存在了无数个世纪，时间久到已经遗失了很多记忆。但是这漫长的时间也使它的灵魂格外强大，最大灵魂值提高50。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: '[PAWN_nameDef] has existed for countless ages and it no longer remembers [PAWN_possessive] purpose. Ancient spirits pursue their own ends and have become masters at controlling spirit energy. Maximum spirit energy is increased by 50.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: [PAWN_nameDef] has existed for countless ages and it no longer remembers [PAWN_possessive] purpose. Ancient spirits pursue their own ends and have become masters at controlling spirit energy. Maximum spirit energy is increased by 50.-->
  <TM_AncientSpiritAdultBS.baseDesc>[PAWN_nameDef]已经存在了无数个世纪，时间久到已经遗失了很多记忆。但是这漫长的时间也使它的灵魂格外强大，最大灵魂值提高50。</TM_AncientSpiritAdultBS.baseDesc>
  <!--原中文: '「边魔」复仇的幽魂', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Vengeful Spirit',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Vengeful Spirit-->
  <TM_VengefulSpiritAdultBS.title>「边魔」复仇的幽魂</TM_VengefulSpiritAdultBS.title>
  <!--原中文: '复仇的幽魂', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Vengeful Spirit',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Vengeful Spirit-->
  <TM_VengefulSpiritAdultBS.titleShort>复仇的幽魂</TM_VengefulSpiritAdultBS.titleShort>
  <!--原中文: '[PAWN_nameDef]的心中充满了怨恨和愤怒，只希望把[PAWN_possessive]痛苦施加给其它生灵。复仇的灵魂在释放灵魂扭曲和灵魂风暴时能够发挥更强的力量，但在入侵一个身体时会造成更大的冲突。灵魂风暴的攻击率提高25%，灵魂扭曲的伤害加成提高6%。灵魂兼容性降低1。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: '[PAWN_nameDef] is a vengeful spirit, full of spite and hatred, wishing only to inflict their misery onto the living. Vengeful spirits are able to exert more power during spirit distortion and spirit storm but are more difficult to harmonize with when possessing a living body. Increases attack rate of spirit storm by 25% and damage bonus of distort spirit by 6%. Reduces compatibility by 1.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: [PAWN_nameDef] is a vengeful spirit, full of spite and hatred, wishing only to inflict their misery onto the living. Vengeful spirits are able to exert more power during spirit distortion and spirit storm but are more difficult to harmonize with when possessing a living body. Increases attack rate of spirit storm by 25% and damage bonus of distort spirit by 6%. Reduces compatibility by 1.-->
  <TM_VengefulSpiritAdultBS.baseDesc>[PAWN_nameDef]的心中充满了怨恨和愤怒，只希望把[PAWN_possessive]痛苦施加给其它生灵。复仇的灵魂在释放灵魂扭曲和灵魂风暴时能够发挥更强的力量，但在入侵一个身体时会造成更大的冲突。灵魂风暴的攻击率提高25%，灵魂扭曲的伤害加成提高6%。灵魂兼容性降低1。</TM_VengefulSpiritAdultBS.baseDesc>
  <!--原中文: '「边魔」迷茫的幽魂', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Lost Spirit',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Lost Spirit-->
  <TM_LostSpiritAdultBS.title>「边魔」迷茫的幽魂</TM_LostSpiritAdultBS.title>
  <!--原中文: '迷茫的幽魂', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Lost Spirit',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Lost Spirit-->
  <TM_LostSpiritAdultBS.titleShort>迷茫的幽魂</TM_LostSpiritAdultBS.titleShort>
  <!--原中文: '一个迷茫徘徊的灵魂，它忘记了过去，失去了未来。迷茫的灵魂在入侵时有更高的兼容性，在特性相似时，融合的更快。增强塑灵：狼灵的能力。持续时间，半径，最大目标加成提高10%。灵魂兼容性提高2。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Lost spirits wander the realm in a constant state of existential anguish, unable to perceive their purpose. The lost readily attach themselves to another's cause and more easily harmonize with kindred spirits. They are also able to strengthen the power of the rally spirit ability. Increase duration, radius, max targets, and bonuses of Spirit Rally by 10%. Increases compatibility by 2.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Lost spirits wander the realm in a constant state of existential anguish, unable to perceive their purpose. The lost readily attach themselves to another's cause and more easily harmonize with kindred spirits. They are also able to strengthen the power of the rally spirit ability. Increase duration, radius, max targets, and bonuses of Spirit Rally by 10%. Increases compatibility by 2.-->
  <TM_LostSpiritAdultBS.baseDesc>一个迷茫徘徊的灵魂，它忘记了过去，失去了未来。迷茫的灵魂在入侵时有更高的兼容性，在特性相似时，融合的更快。增强塑灵：狼灵的能力。持续时间，半径，最大目标加成提高10%。灵魂兼容性提高2。</TM_LostSpiritAdultBS.baseDesc>
  <!--原中文: '「边魔」懊悔的幽魂', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Spirit of Regret',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Spirit of Regret-->
  <TM_RegretSpiritAdultBS.title>「边魔」懊悔的幽魂</TM_RegretSpiritAdultBS.title>
  <!--原中文: '懊悔的幽魂', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Spirit of Regret',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Spirit of Regret-->
  <TM_RegretSpiritAdultBS.titleShort>懊悔的幽魂</TM_RegretSpiritAdultBS.titleShort>
  <!--原中文: '懊悔的灵魂仍然能够记住它们的过去，但它们无法纠正它们曾经犯下的错误。现在，它们像幽灵一样在世界上游荡，充满了悲伤和遗憾，仍然在寻找某种方式来弥补曾经的错误。灵魂虹吸的能力提高20%', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'The spirit of regret is still able to remember their purpose as a spirit, but are were unable to right their wrongs before it was too late. Now they wander the world as a spirit, full of sadness and regret, still searching for a way to fulfill their purpose. Spirits of regret enhance the drain spirit ability by 20%.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: The spirit of regret is still able to remember their purpose as a spirit, but are were unable to right their wrongs before it was too late. Now they wander the world as a spirit, full of sadness and regret, still searching for a way to fulfill their purpose. Spirits of regret enhance the drain spirit ability by 20%.-->
  <TM_RegretSpiritAdultBS.baseDesc>懊悔的灵魂仍然能够记住它们的过去，但它们无法纠正它们曾经犯下的错误。现在，它们像幽灵一样在世界上游荡，充满了悲伤和遗憾，仍然在寻找某种方式来弥补曾经的错误。灵魂虹吸的能力提高20%</TM_RegretSpiritAdultBS.baseDesc>
</LanguageData>
